{"version":1,"content":"<p>據彭博社報道，OpenAI CEO薩姆·奧特曼(Sam Altman)周一表示，他相信AI行業能夠經受住上周英偉達CEO黃仁勳(Jensen Huang)被罷免所引發的不確定性。奧特曼周一在三藩市舉行的Semafor「矽谷與世界」大會上發表講話時表示：「營收和需求增長都如此強勁，因此我認為行業會沒事的。」</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586748.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:49:41.837597+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:23:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:42:58.422763+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:42:58.422763+00:00","content_hash":"48f3903ae99b5c9950a9de63a7feb6db839e208b5f2bd116185b5a64abdecc73","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}